  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>From first law of thermodynamics,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi></math>&nbsp;is change in internal energy and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi></math>&nbsp;is work done.</p><p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>W</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Area</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>under</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>curve</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></math></p><p>Here, volume decreases, hence work done by system will be negative.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4500</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>"
  }
